OL,3,GNEWSAFootball match remembers WW1
OL,4,AChristmas truce
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football match commemorating the
OL,7,FWorld War One Christmas truce has taken
OL,8,Fplace in Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FOn Christmas Day 1914, British and
OL,11,FGerman troops stopped fighting and met
OL,12,Fat several locations in Belgium. A
OL,13,Fsoldier from Newark, William
OL,14,FSetchfield, was present at one near the
OL,15,Fvillage of Messines and he may have
OL,16,Fprovided the football used during the
OL,17,Ftruce.
OL,19,FOn Saturday, Newark Town played a side
OL,20,Ffrom its twin town of Emmendingen in
OL,21,Fwhat was billed a Peace Match.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
