OL,3,GNEWSAFootball match remembers WW1
OL,4,AChristmas truce
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuke Parsons, manager of Newark Town
OL,7,FFC, said: "We've played previously.
OL,8,FIt's two histories, two cultures coming
OL,9,Ftogether to symbolise the friendship of
OL,10,Fwhat we are about."
